#: Lomiri/Components/plugin/ucmousefilters.cpp:1065
msgid "Ignoring AfterItem priority for InverseMouse filters."
msgstr ""
"निरंतर माउस फ़िल्टर्स के लिए नकारात्मक मaus इंटरफ़िल की अवक्षेपित प्राथमिकता।\n"
"\n"
"Note: I've used the word \"निरंतर\" (nirantar) to convey the idea of "
"\"continuous\" or \"forever\", which is not a direct translation but fits "
"the context।"

